The covariance function \eqn{\mathcal{K}} is
\deqn{
\mathcal{K}(t,r)=
\int_0^{\min(t,r)}
\left[
\beta s(u)\iota(u)
\{\phi_{11}(t,u)-\phi_{12}(t,u)\}
\{\phi_{11}(r,u)-\phi_{12}(r,u)\}
